uickly and helps maintains water temperature.<br/></div><div><b>Notes:</b></div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included</div><div>-Available in Matte White and Semi Gloss White</div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\">SBW009/MW</a></div><div><b>NB: </b>Due to limited clearance on the underside of the Lago bath, it is recommended that it be installed onto floors where access is able to be obtained from below. Please consult with installer/specifier as to its suitability.<br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
